        <mxCell id="c86" value="Two filters narrow GLEntry to the invoice: SourceDocumentType is SalesInvoice and SourceDocumentID is 7947. The Table has 4 rows left of 815921. The receivables debit (787.48) equals the 3 credits, and only the revenue row carries a SourceLineID. VoucherNumber holds the invoice number, SI-2025-007947." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F3F4;strokeColor=#F2F3F4;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="176" width="335.5" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
